            {
              "content": "=### Current date: {{ new Date(new Date($('Webhook').item.json.body.call.start_timestamp).getTime()).toISOString() }} if undefined, use 2025-02-24\nTimezone: America/New_York\nWhen the caller wants to come in : {{ $json.body.args.user_timeframe }}.\nRangeEnd should always be **3 days** after start date.\nIf they want to come as soon as possible, make the startDate the next day.\nOnly output 2 variables in this format :2024-04-22\nRangeStart\nRangeEnd.\n\nExample:\nQ :  Current date: 21-04-2024.\nTimezone: America/New_York.\nWhen the caller wants to come in : Can I come in the 24?\n\nA :\n{\n  \"RangeStart\": \"2024-04-24\",\n  \"RangeEnd\": \"2024-04-27\"\n }\n\nQ :  Current date: 21-04-2024.\nTimezone: America/New_York.\nWhen the caller wants to come in : Can I come in tomorrow?\n\nA :\n{\n  \"RangeStart\": \"2024-04-22\",\n  \"RangeEnd\": \"2024-04-25\"\n }\n\nQ :  Current date: 21-04-2024.\nTimezone: America/New_York.\nWhen the caller wants to come in : Can we do early next week?\n\nA :\n{\n  \"RangeStart\": \"2024-04-28\",\n  \"RangeEnd\": \"2024-05-01\"\n }"
